Package: brscan-skey-enhanced
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Brother Scan Enhanced maintainers <noreply@github.com>
Depends: diffutils, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, imagemagick, xdg-utils
Homepage: https://github.com/chainarong-ck/brscan-skey-enhanced
Description: Easier Brother brscan-skey button configuration
 Provides configurable Scan to File, Scan to Image, and Scan to Email
 handlers for Brother scanners on Linux, with a GTK settings application.
 The proprietary Brother scanner driver and brscan-skey must be installed
 separately.
